<title>USA: Lord Abbett Bond reduces monthly dividend.</title>
<headline>Lord Abbett Bond reduces monthly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lord Abbett Bond-Debenture Fund said it will reduce its monthly dividend on its Class A, B and C shares.</p>
<p>The Class A dividend will be reduced to $0.065 per share from $0.070 per share.</p>
<p>The Class B and C dividends will be reduced to $0.059 per share from $0.064 per share.</p>
<p>The new dividends will be payable April 15 to shareholders of record on April 7.</p>
<p>The ticker symbol for Lord Abbett Bond-Debenture Fund class A is, class B is and class C is.</p>
